es":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{W}","name":"Isamaru, Hound of Konda","oracle_id":"cfb756dd-6fe1-430a-8f04-8b10cac62a86","oracle_text":"","power":"2","produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2020-07-17","toughness":"2","type_line":"Legendary Creature — Dog"},{"cmc":4.0,"color_identity":["U"],"colors":["U"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"not_legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"not_legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"not_legal","historic":"not_legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"not_legal","paupercommander":"not_legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{U}","name":"Mindlock Orb","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","oracle_text":"Players can't search libraries.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2008-10-03","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"},{"cmc":0.0,"color_identity":["W"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Plains","oracle_id":"bc71ebf6-2056-41f7-be35-b2e5c34afa99","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {W}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["W"],"released_at":"2026-11-13","toughness":null,"type_line":"Basic Land — Plains"},{"cmc":1.0,"color_identity":["R"],"colors":["R"],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"not_legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"not_legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"not_legal","pioneer":"not_legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{R}","name":"Tarfire","oracle_id":"f07b821c-bbc1-4def-b009-6c03689478d0","oracle_text":"Tarfire deals 2 damage to any target.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2017-10-24","toughness":null,"type_line":"Kindred Instant — Goblin"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Effects that instruct you to reveal or look at cards from the top of you library will still work. Only effects that use the word \"search\" are affected.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect says \"Search your library . . . then shuffle your library,\" you shuffle you libraries even though you can't search.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect says \"You may search your library . . . If you do, shuffle your library\" or \"You may search your library . . . then shuffle your library,\" you can't choose to search, so you won't shuffle.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The number of creatures you control is counted only as Dwarven Priest’s ability resolves. If Dwarven Priest is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.","oracle_id":"6a077a9b-d725-4b14-957f-1586db2adf59","published_at":"2018-07-13","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"As these lands are entering the battlefield, they check for lands that are already on the battlefield. They won't see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Scapeshift, for example).","oracle_id":"74ed0bd3-ac31-41a4-8220-d8e7c8c1c437","published_at":"2019-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If another effect puts these lands onto the battlefield tapped, they enter tapped, even if you control enough lands with the appropriate basic land type.","oracle_id":"74ed0bd3-ac31-41a4-8220-d8e7c8c1c437","published_at":"2019-10-04","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"You can search for any card with the creature type Goblin, including creature or kindred cards. Older cards of type \"Summon Goblin\" and \"Summon Goblins\" also count. You can't search for cards that have Goblin in the name but don't have the creature type Goblin.","oracle_id":"792e1072-00bf-4f63-b956-5f20cdf09f11","published_at":"2008-04-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"After the search is complete, the entire library is shuffled.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Each search works exactly the same as normal except that the opponent doing the searching sees only the top four cards of that library. They can't look at the other cards in that library at all. Cards not in the top four cards of the library can't be found in the search, even if they're identifiable in some manner.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"For effects that check whether a player searched a library or may search a library, searching the top four cards of that library counts as searching that library.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect uses the word \"search\" once but allows an opponent to search for multiple cards, the top four cards remain the same throughout the entire search. Finding one card won't cause the fifth card to become included in the search.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Kindred is a card type that allows noncreature cards to have creature types. For example, Echoes of Eternity is an Eldrazi (although not a creature) while on the battlefield and an Eldrazi card (although not a creature card) in zones other than the battlefield.","oracle_id":"f07b821c-bbc1-4def-b009-6c03689478d0","published_at":"2024-06-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"This cards was originally printed with the \"tribal\" card type. That card type has been replaced with \"kindred\". This change does not affect the gameplay function of this card.","oracle_id":"f07b821c-bbc1-4def-b009-6c03689478d0","published_at":"2024-06-07","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"While it appears only on cards that already have other card types, kindred is a card type and will be counted by effects that refer to the number of card types among cards in a zone.","oracle_id":"f07b821c-bbc1-4def-b009-6c03689478d0","published_at":"2024-06-07","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
